WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Reading aloud improves speaking fluency.. Do one full forty-question Reading

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
test every week.. Listen to ten minutes of an English podcast daily.. Always

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
read the questions before the audio starts.. Writing: five minutes planning,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
twenty-five drafting, five checking.. Use one filler pattern to buy thinking

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
time while speaking.. Word stress matters more than individual sounds.. While

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
reading, mark unknown words and check them later.. Retell what you heard in your

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
own words.. Learn collocations together with new words..
